}</script></a></div></header></div><section class="section_clients"><div class="padding-section-medium"></div><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="clients_head"><div class="clients_head-wrap"><div class="text-color-grey-300"><div class="text-style-label-caption">We ARE</div></div><div class="spacer-custom-2"></div><div><h1 class="heading-style-h1">UI/UX design and development studio for SaaS, AI, defense, and military tech</h1></div><div class="spacer-medium is-tablet-small"></div><div class="max-width-xlarge"><div class="text-color-grey-400"><div class="font-secondary"><div class="text-size-xsmall"><p class="text-weight-medium">Cosmos Studio is a UI/UX design studio for defense and military tech, SaaS, AI, EdTech, and MedTech companies in the US and Europe. One senior team handles research, UX, UI, design systems, and front-end development in React and Next.js, so your product goes from the first interview to working code without handoffs between vendors.<br/><br/>Since 2018, our designers and engineers have contributed to 500+ digital product launches, including the Bravo1Alpha defense tech website, the Loamly AI-native CRM, and the Ply procurement platform. A typical project takes 2–6 weeks.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="clients_auth"><div class="w-embed w-script"><!-- cosmos review ticker v1 (2026-11-11) – replaces the Clutch widget in Intro Section. Reviews are read from #lt-rv on the same page. Rollback: restore previous embed code. -->
<style>
.rtk{width:24.5rem;max-width:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.5rem;text-align:left;color:var(--_colors---primary--black)}
.rtk-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;padding-bottom:1rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--_colors---grey--100)}
.rtk-n{font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1}
.rtk-st{display:flex;gap:2px}
.rtk-st svg{width:15px;height:15px;display:block}
.rtk-lg{margin-left:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.125rem}
.rtk-lg a{display:block;line-height:0;padding:12px 0;margin:-12px 0}
.rtk-lg svg{display:block;height:20px;width:auto}
.rtk-lg .rtk-up{height:26px;margin-top:6px}
.rtk-dv{width:1px;height:20px;background:var(--_colors---grey--100)}
.rtk-vp{height:30rem;overflow:hidden;-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(transparent,#000 12%,#000 88%,transparent);mask-image:linear-gradient(transparent,#000 12%,#000 88%,transparent)}
.rtk-tr{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.125rem;padding:1.5rem 0 1.5rem .5rem;animation:rtk-up var(--rtk-d,40s) linear infinite}
.rtk-vp:hover .rtk-tr,.rtk-vp:focus-within .rtk-tr,.rtk-vp.is-paused .rtk-tr{animation-play-state:paused}
.rtk-vp{cursor:pointer}
@keyframes rtk-up{from{transform:translateY(0)}to{transform:translateY(calc(-50% + .9375rem))}}
.rtk-it{margin:0;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:.875rem}
.rtk-av{flex:none;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--_colors---grey--100);font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:600}
.rtk-bb{position:relative;background:var(--_colors---primary--white);border-radius:18px 18px 18px 4px;padding:.75rem 1rem .625rem;box-shadow:0 1px 1px rgba(15,16,17,.06)}
.rtk-bb:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:-8px;bottom:0;width:12px;height:14px;background:var(--_colors---primary--white);-webkit-clip-path:path("M12 0 V14 H0 C6 12 10 8 12 0 Z");clip-path:path("M12 0 V14 H0 C6 12 10 8 12 0 Z")}
.rtk-who{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px;margin:0 0 .375rem;text-align:left;font-size:.8125rem;line-height:1.35}
.rtk-who b{font-weight:600}
.rtk-who span,.rtk-ts{color:var(--_colors---grey--400)}
.rtk-q{margin:0;padding:0;border:0;font-size:.9375rem;line-height:1.5}
.rtk-ts{margin-top:.375rem;text-align:right;font-size:.6875rem}
.rtk-more{align-self:center;margin-top:.5rem;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.375rem;min-height:44px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;font-size:.875rem;font-weight:500}
.rtk-roll{display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;height:1.4em;line-height:1.4em}
.rtk-roll span{display:block;transition:transform .5s cubic-bezier(.25,1,.5,1)}
.rtk-more svg{transition:transform .4s cubic-bezier(.25,1,.5,1)}
.rtk-more:hover .rtk-roll span{transform:translateY(-100%)}
.rtk-more:hover svg{transform:translateY(3px)}
.rtk-more:focus-visible{outline:2px solid currentColor;outline-offset:4px;border-radius:4px}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){.rtk-lg path,.rtk-lg rect,.rtk-lg polygon,.rtk-lg ellipse{fill:var(--_colors---primary--black)}.rtk-bb{box-shadow:none}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.rtk-tr{animation:none}.rtk-vp{overflow-y:auto;cursor:auto}.rtk-it[aria-hidden]{display:none}}
@media screen and (max-width:991px){.rtk{width:100%}.rtk-vp{height:26rem}}
@media screen and (max-width:767px){.rtk-vp{height:25rem}.rtk-more{font-size:.9375rem;margin-top:1rem}}
@media screen and (max-width:479px){.rtk{padding:0 .75rem;box-sizing:border-box}.rtk-n{font-size:2.125rem}.rtk-top{gap:.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap}.rtk-lg{gap:.75rem}.rtk-lg svg{height:17px}.rtk-lg .rtk-up{height:22px;margin-top:5px}.rtk-av{width:32px;height:32px}}
</style>
