</style><div class="lt" id="lt-rv"><div class="lt-tp"><div class="lt-lb">Client references</div><h2 class="lt-h">Trusted by product teams across the US and Europe</h2><div class="lt-rt"><span class="lt-n">5.0</span><span><b aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</b><span>36 verified reviews on <a class="lt-lk" data-lt-fl href="https://clutch.co/profile/cosmos-studio#reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="lt-tx"><span class="lt-t1">Clutch</span><span class="lt-t2" aria-hidden="true">Clutch</span></span><i class="lt-dt" aria-hidden="true"></i></a> and <a class="lt-lk" data-lt-fl href="https://www.upwork.com/freelancers/~015ca4d690aaad6f7b" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="lt-tx"><span class="lt-t1">Upwork</span><span class="lt-t2" aria-hidden="true">Upwork</span></span><i class="lt-dt" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></span></span></div></div><div class="lt-st" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Client reviews"><div class="lt-s1" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="lt-s2w" aria-hidden="true"><div class="lt-s2"></div></div><div class="lt-pp"><article class="lt-p lt-on" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="1 of 20"><header class="lt-hd"><div><span class="lt-co">SerenX</span><span class="lt-wh">Defense tech · Melbourne, FL, USA</span></div><div class="lt-vr"><span>Verified review on <img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" loading="lazy"></span><span>May 2026 – ongoing</span></div></header><dl class="lt-mt"><dt>To</dt><dd>Cosmos Studio</dd><dt>Project</dt><dd>Website design, development &amp; content</dd></dl><blockquote class="lt-bd"><p class="lt-q">“Over my 27 year career, they are the best website agency I have ever worked with.”</p><p>Before going live, we privately shared it with approximately 100 people, including prospective government customers and aerospace and defense industry partners. The response was overwhelmingly positive.</p><p>Several people even commented that our website was better than Anduril&#x27;s, which is a remarkable compliment for a young defense technology company.</p><p>I’m impressed by how much Cosmos Studio cares and their attention to detail. For example, they’ve even made a small browser game for our 404 page.</p></blockquote><footer class="lt-ft"><div class="lt-sg"><img class="lt-ph" src="/assets/img/review-scott.webp" alt="Scott Hasbrouck" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64"><div><cite>Scott Hasbrouck</cite><span>CTO &amp; Founder, SerenX</span></div></div><a class="lt-pl" href="https://clutch.co/profile/cosmos-studio#review-494801" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Reviewed on Clutch, 5.0 rating"><img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" height="14" loading="lazy"><i></i><b aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</b><span>5.0</span></a></footer></article><article class="lt-p" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="2 of 20"><header class="lt-hd"><div><span class="lt-co">Sentinel Earth AG</span><span class="lt-wh">Carbon markets · Switzerland</span></div><div class="lt-vr"><span>Verified review on <img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" loading="lazy"></span><span>Jan – Aug 2026</span></div></header><dl class="lt-mt"><dt>To</dt><dd>Cosmos Studio</dd><dt>Project</dt><dd>Website redesign · $10K–$50K</dd></dl><blockquote class="lt-bd"><p class="lt-q">“The animation work stood out: it was visually strong and is a big part of what gives our site its character.”</p><p>They also got to the direction we wanted quickly, and stayed involved past handover, joining calls with our developers to walk them through the designs.</p><p>What we do have is a complete set of designs and assets, all signed off internally, with nothing outstanding at handover.</p></blockquote><footer class="lt-ft"><div class="lt-sg"><img class="lt-ph" src="/assets/img/review-linden.webp" alt="Linden Felder" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64"><div><cite>Linden Felder</cite><span>Head of Communications &amp; Marketing, Sentinel Earth AG</span></div></div><a class="lt-pl" href="https://clutch.co/profile/cosmos-studio#reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Reviewed on Clutch, 5.0 rating"><img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" height="14" loading="lazy"><i></i><b aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</b><span>5.0</span></a></footer></article><article class="lt-p" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="3 of 20"><header class="lt-hd"><div><span class="lt-co">Umami Ware GmbH</span><span class="lt-wh">Optometry software · Germany</span></div><div class="lt-vr"><span>Verified review on <img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" loading="lazy"></span><span>Feb 2019 – Sep 2024</span></div></header><dl class="lt-mt"><dt>To</dt><dd>Cosmos Studio</dd><dt>Project</dt><dd>Branding, app design &amp; website · $200K+</dd></dl><blockquote class="lt-bd"><p class="lt-q">“We were impressed with Cosmos Studio&#x27;s focus on delivering impactful product solutions that significantly enhanced our UX.”</p><p>Their innovative approach to product design and attention to detail in UX made a substantial difference to the overall functionality and appeal of our product. The thoughtful integration of these solutions has greatly contributed to the product&#x27;s success and user satisfaction.</p><p>Their structured planning and timely completion of tasks ensure that everything runs smoothly and efficiently.</p></blockquote><footer class="lt-ft"><div class="lt-sg"><img class="lt-ph" src="/assets/img/review-johannes.webp" alt="Johannes Artmeier" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64"><div><cite>Johannes Artmeier</cite><span>CTO &amp; Product Manager, Umami Ware GmbH</span></div></div><a class="lt-pl" href="https://clutch.co/profile/cosmos-studio#reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Reviewed on Clutch, 5.0 rating"><img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" height="14" loading="lazy"><i></i><b aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</b><span>5.0</span></a></footer></article><article class="lt-p" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="4 of 20"><header class="lt-hd"><div><span class="lt-co">Casavo</span><span class="lt-wh">Real estate platform · Italy</span></div><div class="lt-vr"><span>Verified review on <img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" loading="lazy"></span><span>Mar – May 2026</span></div></header><dl class="lt-mt"><dt>To</dt><dd>Cosmos Studio</dd><dt>Project</dt><dd>Website revamp</dd></dl><blockquote class="lt-bd"><p class="lt-q">“The redesigned website gives Casavo a significantly stronger digital presence.”</p><p>What stood out most was how quickly Cosmos Studio grasped the complexity of our product and user base. They translated that understanding into a design that feels both polished and purposeful.</p><p>The new experience is cleaner, faster to navigate, and much more aligned with what our users actually need. It’s made a noticeable difference in how we present the brand online and how users engage with the platform.</p></blockquote><footer class="lt-ft"><div class="lt-sg"><img class="lt-ph" src="/assets/img/review-vittorio.webp" alt="Vittorio Machet" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64"><div><cite>Vittorio Machet</cite><span>Growth Specialist, Casavo</span></div></div><a class="lt-pl" href="https://clutch.co/profile/cosmos-studio#reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Reviewed on Clutch, 5.0 rating"><img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" height="14" loading="lazy"><i></i><b aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</b><span>5.0</span></a></footer></article><article class="lt-p" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="5 of 20"><header class="lt-hd"><div><span class="lt-co">Freq</span><span class="lt-wh">Event systems · Austin, TX, USA</span></div><div class="lt-vr"><span>Verified review on <img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" loading="lazy"></span><span>Jul 2025 – ongoing</span></div></header><dl class="lt-mt"><dt>To</dt><dd>Cosmos Studio</dd><dt>Project</dt><dd>Web design, development &amp; motion</dd></dl><blockquote class="lt-bd"><p class="lt-q">“Their attention to detail and ability to keep everything consistent made the whole experience feel very professional and smooth.”</p><p>What impressed us most was how quickly the team understood our needs and turned them into clear, thoughtful design solutions.</p><p>We got a clean, modern design that was easy to understand and use. The pages became clearer, the structure made more sense, and the final result helped us present our product much better.</p></blockquote><footer class="lt-ft"><div class="lt-sg"><img class="lt-ph" src="/assets/img/review-lian.webp" alt="Lian Amber" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64"><div><cite>Lian Amber</cite><span>CEO, Freq</span></div></div><a class="lt-pl" href="https://clutch.co/profile/cosmos-studio#reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Reviewed on Clutch, 5.0 rating"><img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" height="14" loading="lazy"><i></i><b aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</b><span>5.0</span></a></footer></article><article class="lt-p" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="6 of 20"><header class="lt-hd"><div><span class="lt-co">Neo Vision</span><span class="lt-wh">Digital product studio · Bucharest, Romania</span></div><div class="lt-vr"><span>Verified review on <img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" loading="lazy"></span><span>Jan 2023 – ongoing</span></div></header><dl class="lt-mt"><dt>To</dt><dd>Cosmos Studio</dd><dt>Project</dt><dd>Website, branding &amp; presentations · $50K–$200K</dd></dl><blockquote class="lt-bd"><p class="lt-q">“Cosmos Studio impressed us with their creativity and innovative solutions, which led to an outstanding final result.”</p><p>The seamless communication throughout the project was also exceptional, ensuring everything ran smoothly and efficiently.</p><p>We had weekly meetings to ensure clear communication and closely track progress. The workflow was smooth, and the team was aligned throughout the project.</p></blockquote><footer class="lt-ft"><div class="lt-sg"><img class="lt-ph" src="/assets/img/review-adrian.webp" alt="Adrian Niculescu" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64"><div><cite>Adrian Niculescu</cite><span>CEO &amp; Co-Founder, Neo Vision</span></div></div><a class="lt-pl" href="https://clutch.co/profile/cosmos-studio#reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Reviewed on Clutch, 5.0 rating"><img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" height="14" loading="lazy"><i></i><b aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</b><span>5.0</span></a></footer></article><article class="lt-p" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="7 of 20"><header class="lt-hd"><div><span class="lt-co">AI software company</span><span class="lt-wh">AI tools for knowledge workers · San Francisco, CA, USA</span></div><div class="lt-vr"><span>Verified review on <img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" loading="lazy"></span><span>Dec 2023 – Feb 2024</span></div></header><dl class="lt-mt"><dt>To</dt><dd>Cosmos Studio</dd><dt>Project</dt><dd>Interactive AI prototype &amp; brand kit</dd></dl><blockquote class="lt-bd"><p class="lt-q">“Incredible team, passionate leaders, astounding service.”</p><p>Delivered a complex E2E prototype for an AI desktop concept app including complex workflows and animations.</p><p>Delivered a complete interactive brand kit and brand book including custom logo and detailed guidelines for brand use.</p></blockquote><footer class="lt-ft"><div class="lt-sg"><img class="lt-ph" src="/assets/img/review-pierre.webp" alt="Pierre Tapia" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64"><div><cite>Pierre Tapia</cite><span>Lead, AI software company</span></div></div><a class="lt-pl" href="https://clutch.co/profile/cosmos-studio#reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Reviewed on Clutch, 5.0 rating"><img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" height="14" loading="lazy"><i></i><b aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</b><span>5.0</span></a></footer></article><article class="lt-p" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="8 of 20"><header class="lt-hd"><div><span class="lt-co">Plarium</span><span class="lt-wh">Video games</span></div><div class="lt-vr"><span>Verified review on <img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" loading="lazy"></span><span>Nov 2022 – May 2024</span></div></header><dl class="lt-mt"><dt>To</dt><dd>Cosmos Studio</dd><dt>Project</dt><dd>Landing pages &amp; motion design · $50K–$200K</dd></dl><blockquote class="lt-bd"><p class="lt-q">“We had an excellent experience with Cosmos Studio and have no suggestions for improvement.”</p><p>We were most impressed by the seamless coordination, clear communication, and high-quality results. The motion design was exceptional, and the creative ideas for the landing pages were outstanding.</p><p>The team consistently met deadlines and effectively addressed our feedback. And their level of creativity was more than we expected!</p></blockquote><footer class="lt-ft"><div class="lt-sg"><img class="lt-ph" src="/assets/img/review-oleksandr.webp" alt="Oleksandr Piddubnyi" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64"><div><cite>Oleksandr Piddubnyi</cite><span>Director of Employer Brand &amp; Communications, Plarium</span></div></div><a class="lt-pl" href="https://clutch.co/profile/cosmos-studio#reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Reviewed on Clutch, 5.0 rating"><img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" height="14" loading="lazy"><i></i><b aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</b><span>5.0</span></a></footer></article><article class="lt-p" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="9 of 20"><header class="lt-hd"><div><span class="lt-co">EdCamp Ukraine</span><span class="lt-wh">Education · Ukraine</span></div><div class="lt-vr"><span>Verified review on <img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" loading="lazy"></span><span>Nov 2022 – Jun 2024</span></div></header><dl class="lt-mt"><dt>To</dt><dd>Cosmos Studio</dd><dt>Project</dt><dd>Education platform UX/UI · $50K–$200K</dd></dl><blockquote class="lt-bd"><p class="lt-q">“Their ability to combine strategic thinking with strong execution made the process feel thoughtful and efficient.”</p><p>We were most impressed by Cosmos Studio’s sense of responsibility and deep understanding of our product. They confidently led us through every stage — from research and user interviews to final designs — always staying focused on our goals.</p><p>They conducted all user interviews and research independently, helping us validate ideas and uncover user needs. Their work turned early concepts into a clear, intuitive product experience.</p></blockquote><footer class="lt-ft"><div class="lt-sg"><img class="lt-ph" src="/assets/img/review-halyna.webp" alt="Halyna Kovalchuk" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64"><div><cite>Halyna Kovalchuk</cite><span>Leading Specialist, EdCamp Ukraine</span></div></div><a class="lt-pl" href="https://clutch.co/profile/cosmos-studio#reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Reviewed on Clutch, 5.0 rating"><img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" height="14" loading="lazy"><i></i><b aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</b><span>5.0</span></a></footer></article><article class="lt-p" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="10 of 20"><header class="lt-hd"><div><span class="lt-co">Elevated Signals</span><span class="lt-wh">Manufacturing software · Vancouver, Canada</span></div><div class="lt-vr"><span>Verified review on <img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" loading="lazy"></span><span>Mar – Jun 2025</span></div></header><dl class="lt-mt"><dt>To</dt><dd>Cosmos Studio</dd><dt>Project</dt><dd>Website &amp; brand refresh · $10K–$50K</dd></dl><blockquote class="lt-bd"><p class="lt-q">“They were a great partner!”</p><p>There was an instant culture fit with the designers who were able to translate our vision into a design concept right out of the gate.</p><p>I&#x27;ve worked with a lot of agencies in my time, and I found Cosmos&#x27; project management some of the best.</p></blockquote><footer class="lt-ft"><div class="lt-sg"><img class="lt-ph" src="/assets/img/review-libby.webp" alt="Libby Cutress" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64"><div><cite>Libby Cutress</cite><span>Director of Marketing &amp; Communications, Elevated Signals</span></div></div><a class="lt-pl" href="https://clutch.co/profile/cosmos-studio#reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Reviewed on Clutch, 5.0 rating"><img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" height="14" loading="lazy"><i></i><b aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</b><span>5.0</span></a></footer></article><article class="lt-p" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="11 of 20"><header class="lt-hd"><div><span class="lt-co">Zeuss LLC</span><span class="lt-wh">Healthcare e-commerce · Miami, FL, USA</span></div><div class="lt-vr"><span>Verified review on <img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" loading="lazy"></span><span>Sep 2021 – ongoing</span></div></header><dl class="lt-mt"><dt>To</dt><dd>Cosmos Studio</dd><dt>Project</dt><dd>UX/UI, development &amp; animation · $200K+</dd></dl><blockquote class="lt-bd"><p class="lt-q">“We were very happy with the process and results.”</p><p>Their attention to detail and ability to turn complex ideas into clean, user-friendly designs was truly impressive.</p><p>Increased user engagement and time spent on the site. Higher conversion rates due to a clearer UX and modern interface. Improved mobile performance and loading speed.</p></blockquote><footer class="lt-ft"><div class="lt-sg"><div><cite>Jonas Siuksta</cite><span>CEO, Zeuss LLC</span></div></div><a class="lt-pl" href="https://clutch.co/profile/cosmos-studio#reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Reviewed on Clutch, 5.0 rating"><img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" height="14" loading="lazy"><i></i><b aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</b><span>5.0</span></a></footer></article><article class="lt-p" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="12 of 20"><header class="lt-hd"><div><span class="lt-co">Education NGO</span><span class="lt-wh">Education nonprofit · Kyiv, Ukraine</span></div><div class="lt-vr"><span>Verified review on <img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" loading="lazy"></span><span>Dec 2021 – Nov 2022</span></div></header><dl class="lt-mt"><dt>To</dt><dd>Cosmos Studio</dd><dt>Project</dt><dd>Website design &amp; animation · $10K–$50K</dd></dl><blockquote class="lt-bd"><p class="lt-q">“Their team is reliable, creative, and easy to work with.”</p><p>We were most impressed by the animated main screen — it created a strong first impression and perfectly reflected our identity.</p><p>The new website improved how we communicate our mission and projects. We saw increased engagement, more traffic to key initiatives, and positive feedback from our partners and community.</p></blockquote><footer class="lt-ft"><div class="lt-sg"><img class="lt-ph" src="/assets/img/review-volodymyr.webp" alt="Volodymyr Kysylenko" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64"><div><cite>Volodymyr Kysylenko</cite><span>CTO, Education NGO</span></div></div><a class="lt-pl" href="https://clutch.co/profile/cosmos-studio#reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Reviewed on Clutch, 5.0 rating"><img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" height="14" loading="lazy"><i></i><b aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</b><span>5.0</span></a></footer></article><article class="lt-p" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="13 of 20"><header class="lt-hd"><div><span class="lt-co">Fokus Nachhilfe</span><span class="lt-wh">Tutoring platform · Zurich, Switzerland</span></div><div class="lt-vr"><span>Verified review on <img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" loading="lazy"></span><span>Jan 2025 – ongoing</span></div></header><dl class="lt-mt"><dt>To</dt><dd>Cosmos Studio</dd><dt>Project</dt><dd>Website &amp; user flows · $10K–$50K</dd></dl><blockquote class="lt-bd"><p class="lt-q">“Their attention to detail and ability to maintain consistency make the experience feel very professional and smooth.”</p><p>What impressed us most was how quickly the team understood our needs and turned them into clear, thoughtful design solutions.</p><p>We received a clean, modern, and intuitive design that significantly improved clarity and usability, with a well-structured layout and clear user flows.</p></blockquote><footer class="lt-ft"><div class="lt-sg"><img class="lt-ph" src="/assets/img/review-liam.webp" alt="Liam Mörker" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64"><div><cite>Liam Mörker</cite><span>Co-Founder, Fokus Nachhilfe</span></div></div><a class="lt-pl" href="https://clutch.co/profile/cosmos-studio#reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Reviewed on Clutch, 5.0 rating"><img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" height="14" loading="lazy"><i></i><b aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</b><span>5.0</span></a></footer></article><article class="lt-p" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="14 of 20"><header class="lt-hd"><div><span class="lt-co">Make it Real Foundation</span><span class="lt-wh">Nonprofit · Ukraine</span></div><div class="lt-vr"><span>Verified review on <img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" loading="lazy"></span><span>Feb 2023 – Dec 2024</span></div></header><dl class="lt-mt"><dt>To</dt><dd>Cosmos Studio</dd><dt>Project</dt><dd>UX research, UI &amp; animation</dd></dl><blockquote class="lt-bd"><p class="lt-q">“What impressed us most was how deeply Cosmos Studio immersed themselves in the project.”</p><p>The storytelling concept was fully developed by their team, and they guided us through every step, aligning strategy, design, and emotion. The end result perfectly captured our mission and helped us present it to a wide audience in a bold, engaging way.</p><p>The website was launched recently, but even now we’re seeing early signs of increased engagement and positive feedback from our audience.</p></blockquote><footer class="lt-ft"><div class="lt-sg"><img class="lt-ph" src="/assets/img/review-anna.webp" alt="Anna Kysil" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64"><div><cite>Anna Kysil</cite><span>Deputy CEO, Make it Real Foundation</span></div></div><a class="lt-pl" href="https://clutch.co/profile/cosmos-studio#reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Reviewed on Clutch, 5.0 rating"><img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" height="14" loading="lazy"><i></i><b aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</b><span>5.0</span></a></footer></article><article class="lt-p" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="15 of 20"><header class="lt-hd"><div><span class="lt-co">Sirius Animal Shelter</span><span class="lt-wh">Animal shelter · Ukraine</span></div><div class="lt-vr"><span>Verified review on <img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" loading="lazy"></span><span>Aug 2022 – Jul 2023</span></div></header><dl class="lt-mt"><dt>To</dt><dd>Cosmos Studio</dd><dt>Project</dt><dd>Website redesign &amp; custom CRM · $50K–$200K</dd></dl><blockquote class="lt-bd"><p class="lt-q">“They handled challenges with confidence, so we didn’t feel anything needed improvement.”</p><p>We were most impressed by their creativity. The team came up with a unique and thoughtful website concept that made the adoption process feel more emotional and engaging for users.</p><p>We saw an increase in adoption requests, donations, and volunteer sign-ups. Internally, the custom CRM helped us streamline our work and save time managing applications.</p></blockquote><footer class="lt-ft"><div class="lt-sg"><div><cite>Sirius team</cite><span>PR, Sirius Animal Shelter</span></div></div><a class="lt-pl" href="https://clutch.co/profile/cosmos-studio#reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Reviewed on Clutch, 5.0 rating"><img src="/assets/img/review-clutch-logo.png" alt="Clutch" height="14" loading="lazy"><i></i><b aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</b><span>5.0</span></a></footer></article><article class="lt-p" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="16 of 20"><header class="lt-hd"><div><span class="lt-co">Loamly</span><span class="lt-wh">AI-native CRM · Zurich, Switzerland</span></div><div class="lt-vr"><span>Verified review on <img src="/assets/img/review-upwork-logo.png" alt="Upwork" loading="lazy"></span><span>Aug – Oct 2025</span></div></header><dl class="lt-mt"><dt>To</dt><dd>Cosmos Studio</dd><dt>Project</dt><dd>Brand identity &amp; UI/UX</dd></dl><blockquote class="lt-bd"><p class="lt-q">“Illia and Cosmos team have delivered everything I asked on time and within the budget.”</p><p>The most important aspect for me in this project was to understand my ideas / needs and professionally translate them into a polished UI and when needed challenge things. They&#x27;ve overachieved this also being very responsive.</p><p>Collaboration is super smooth and they&#x27;re super kind, which is also important for me. (Important to work with people you enjoy collaborating with).</p></blockquote><footer class="lt-ft"><div class="lt-sg"><img class="lt-ph" src="/assets/img/review-marco.webp" alt="Marco Di Cesare" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64"><div><cite>Marco Di Cesare</cite><span>Founder, Loamly</span></div></div><a class="lt-pl" href="https://www.upwork.com/freelancers/~015ca4d690aaad6f7b" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Reviewed on Upwork, Top Rated Plus"><img src="/assets/img/review-upwork-logo.png" alt="Upwork" height="12" loading="lazy"><i></i><span>Top Rated Plus</span></a></footer></article><article class="lt-p" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="17 of 20"><header class="lt-hd"><div><img class="lt-lg" src="/assets/img/review-ply-logo.svg" alt="Ply" loading="lazy" width="50" height="33" style="align-self:flex-start"><span class="lt-wh">Materials management software · New York, USA</span></div><div class="lt-vr"><span>Verified review on <img src="/assets/img/review-upwork-logo.png" alt="Upwork" loading="lazy"></span><span>Feb 2023 – Present</span></div></header><dl class="lt-mt"><dt>To</dt><dd>Cosmos Studio</dd><dt>Project</dt><dd>Website, web &amp; mobile app UX/UI</dd></dl><blockquote class="lt-bd"><p class="lt-q">“Working with Cosmos Studio has been an exceptional experience!”</p><p>They delivered outstanding results on our website design and UX/UI design for a complex web and mobile app. Their attention to detail and ability to translate our vision into a seamless, user-friendly interface exceeded our expectations.</p><p>In addition to their expertise in UX/UI design, Cosmos Studio also supported us with various graphic design tasks, showcasing their versatility and commitment to high-quality work. Their team was professional, communicative, and always ready to go the extra mile to ensure we were satisfied.</p><p>We couldn’t be happier with the results and highly recommend Cosmos Studio to anyone looking for top-tier design services. Thank you for helping us bring our project to life!</p></blockquote><footer class="lt-ft"><div class="lt-sg"><img class="lt-ph" src="/assets/img/review-darion.webp" alt="Darion Miller" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64"><div><cite>Darion Miller</cite><span>Co-founder &amp; COO, Ply</span></div></div><a class="lt-pl" href="https://www.upwork.com/freelancers/~015ca4d690aaad6f7b" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Reviewed on Upwork, Expert-Vetted"><img src="/assets/img/review-upwork-logo.png" alt="Upwork" height="12" loading="lazy"><i></i><span>Expert-Vetted</span></a></footer></article><article class="lt-p" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="18 of 20"><header class="lt-hd"><div><span class="lt-co">Product creative</span><span class="lt-wh">3D, motion &amp; brand assets</span></div><div class="lt-vr"><span>Verified review on <img src="/assets/img/review-upwork-logo.png" alt="Upwork" loading="lazy"></span><span>Jan – May 2025</span></div></header><dl class="lt-mt"><dt>To</dt><dd>Cosmos Studio</dd><dt>Project</dt><dd>Product creative design</dd></dl><blockquote class="lt-bd"><p class="lt-q">“Working with the Cosmos Studio team was a pleasure.”</p><p>We collaborated on a wide range of creative tasks — from adapting brand elements to a new visual style, to crafting 3D models, Lottie animations, slider transitions, preloader visuals, and custom iconography. The team used tools like Figma and Cinema 4D to bring our vision to life with precision and creativity, delivering clean, scalable assets and thoughtful design solutions.</p><p>They worked in sync with our internal team, which made the collaboration smooth and efficient. Weekly check-in calls (once or twice a week) kept everything on track and aligned.</p><p>We would absolutely recommend them for any advanced design needs.</p></blockquote><footer class="lt-ft"><div class="lt-sg"><div><cite>Upwork client</cite><span>Client on Upwork</span></div></div><a class="lt-pl" href="https://www.upwork.com/freelancers/~015ca4d690aaad6f7b" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Reviewed on Upwork, Top Rated Plus"><img src="/assets/img/review-upwork-logo.png" alt="Upwork" height="12" loading="lazy"><i></i><span>Top Rated Plus</span></a></footer></article><article class="lt-p" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="19 of 20"><header class="lt-hd"><div><span class="lt-co">Yawn’s World</span><span class="lt-wh">Homepage redesign</span></div><div class="lt-vr"><span>Verified review on <img src="/assets/img/review-upwork-logo.png" alt="Upwork" loading="lazy"></span><span>Aug – Sep 2024</span></div></header><dl class="lt-mt"><dt>To</dt><dd>Cosmos Studio</dd><dt>Project</dt><dd>UX website design</dd></dl><blockquote class="lt-bd"><p class="lt-q">“I had the pleasure of working with Illia and the Cosmos Studio team on redesigning our homepage for Yawn’s World, and I am thrilled with the results.”</p><p>From the start, Illia showed a deep understanding of our brand and vision. The new design is visually stunning and perfectly captures the essence of what Yawn’s World is all about.</p><p>The entire process was seamless, with Cosmos Studio providing exceptional communication and professionalism at every step. They took our ideas and brought them to life in a way that exceeded our expectations. The team’s expertise in UI/UX design is evident in the final product – it’s modern, engaging, and user-friendly.</p><p>Thanks to Illia and his talented team, our website now stands out and provides an enhanced experience for our visitors. I highly recommend Cosmos Studio for anyone looking to elevate their online presence with a top-notch design. We’ll definitely be collaborating with them again in the future!</p></blockquote><footer class="lt-ft"><div class="lt-sg"><div><cite>Yawn’s World team</cite><span>Client on Upwork</span></div></div><a class="lt-pl" href="https://www.upwork.com/freelancers/~015ca4d690aaad6f7b" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Reviewed on Upwork, Expert-Vetted"><img src="/assets/img/review-upwork-logo.png" alt="Upwork" height="12" loading="lazy"><i></i><span>Expert-Vetted</span></a></footer></article><article class="lt-p" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="20 of 20"><header class="lt-hd"><div><span class="lt-co">AI chat system</span><span class="lt-wh">AI product · Maui, HI, USA</span></div><div class="lt-vr"><span>Verified review on <img src="/assets/img/review-upwork-logo.png" alt="Upwork" loading="lazy"></span><span>May – Jul 2024</span></div></header><dl class="lt-mt"><dt>To</dt><dd>Cosmos Studio</dd><dt>Project</dt><dd>UI &amp; UX design</dd></dl><blockquote class="lt-bd"><p class="lt-q">“Working with Illia on our AI chat system design project was an exceptional experience.”</p><p>Illia demonstrated a deep understanding of user experience and exhibited outstanding proficiency in UI design using Figma. He designed multiple pages that were not only visually appealing but also highly functional and intuitive.</p><p>His attention to detail and ability to understand user behavior helped us achieve a clean, user-friendly interface. The project was completed successfully, and we couldn’t be more satisfied with the results. Illia’s work truly exceeded our expectations. Highly recommended!</p></blockquote><footer class="lt-ft"><div class="lt-sg"><img class="lt-ph" src="/assets/img/review-peter.webp" alt="Peter Cobabe" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64"><div><cite>Peter Cobabe</cite><span>Founder &amp; CEO, Adaptr AI</span></div></div><a class="lt-pl" href="https://www.upwork.com/freelancers/~015ca4d690aaad6f7b" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Reviewed on Upwork, Top Rated Plus"><img src="/assets/img/review-upwork-logo.png" alt="Upwork" height="12" loading="lazy"><i></i><span>Top Rated Plus</span></a></footer></article></div></div><div class="lt-ct"><div class="lt-bt"><button type="button" class="lt-b lt-pv" aria-label="Previous review">←</button><button type="button" class="lt-b lt-nx" aria-label="Next review">→</button><span class="lt-cn" aria-live="polite">01 / 20</span></div><div class="lt-al"><a class="lt-lk" data-lt-fl href="https://clutch.co/profile/cosmos-studio#reviews" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="lt-tx"><span class="lt-t1">Read all reviews on Clutch ↗</span><span class="lt-t2" aria-hidden="true">Read all reviews on Clutch ↗</span></span><i class="lt-dt" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></div></div></div><script>(function(){var r=document.getElementById('lt-rv');if(!r)return;var w=r.closest('.reviews-wr');if(w&&w.offsetParent===null)return;var s=r.closest('.section_testimonials');if(s)s.classList.add('lt-dark');r.querySelectorAll('[data-lt-fl]').forEach(function(a){a.querySelectorAll('.lt-t1,.lt-t2').forEach(function(t){var s=t.textContent;t.textContent='';Array.from(s).forEach(function(ch,k){var e=document.createElement('span');e.className='lt-ch';e.style.setProperty('--i',k);e.textContent=ch;t.appendChild(e)})});a.addEventListener('mouseenter',function(){a.classList.add('lt-hv')});a.addEventListener('mouseleave',function(){a.classList.remove('lt-hv')})});var P=r.querySelectorAll('.lt-p'),n=P.length,i=0,c=r.querySelector('.lt-cn'),s2=r.querySelector('.lt-s2w');function pad(x){return(x<10?'0':'')+x}function go(d){var o=P[i];i=(i+d+n)%n;var p=P[i];o.classList.remove('lt-on','lt-in-n','lt-in-p');p.classList.remove('lt-in-n','lt-in-p');void p.offsetWidth;p.classList.add('lt-on',d>0?'lt-in-n':'lt-in-p');s2.classList.remove('lt-nd');void s2.offsetWidth;s2.classList.add('lt-nd');c.textContent=pad(i+1)+' / '+pad(n);var b=p.querySelector('.lt-bd');if(b)b.scrollTop=0;if(window.innerWidth<992){var t=r.querySelector('.lt-st').getBoundingClientRect().top;if(t<0)window.scrollBy({top:t-24,behavior:'smooth'})}}r.querySelector('.lt-pv').addEventListener('click',function(){go(-1)});r.querySelector('.lt-nx').addEventListener('click',function(){go(1)});var x0=null,y0=0,st=r.querySelector('.lt-st');st.addEventListener('touchstart',function(e){x0=e.touches[0].clientX;y0=e.touches[0].clientY},{passive:true});st.addEventListener('touchend',function(e){if(x0===null)return;var dx=e.changedTouches[0].clientX-x0,dy=e.changedTouches[0].clientY-y0;if(Math.abs(dx)>50&&Math.abs(dx)>Math.abs(dy))go(dx<0?1:-1);x0=null},{passive:true})})();
