/div></div><div class="button_glow-wrap"><div class="button_glow"></div></div></div></a></div></div><div class="home-services_desc"><div class="home-services_img-wrap"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/remroom_1.webp" alt="Remroom sleep tech brand identity by Cosmos Studio" class="home-services_img"/></div><div class="home-services_text-wrap"><p class="text-color-grey-300-2">Health and wellness website design agency for wellness brands, apps, and subscription e-commerce. Brand, UX, UI, and code from one senior team.</p></div></div><div class="service-button_mobile"><a data-wf--button--variant="medium-light" href="/industries/health-wellness" class="button w-variant-9cb96ae5-a355-784d-c2ef-0196f705ac57 w-inline-block"><div class="button-in w-variant-9cb96ae5-a355-784d-c2ef-0196f705ac57"><div class="button_texts w-variant-9cb96ae5-a355-784d-c2ef-0196f705ac57"><div class="button_text w-variant-9cb96ae5-a355-784d-c2ef-0196f705ac57 _1">Show more</div><div aria-hidden="true" class="button_text w-variant-9cb96ae5-a355-784d-c2ef-0196f705ac57 _2">Show more</div></div><div class="button_glow-wrap"><div class="button_glow"></div></div></div></a></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="service-sticky w-dyn-item"><div data-wf--home-services_item--variant="base" class="home-services_item"><div class="line-2 is-darker"></div><div class="home-services_item-in"><div class="home-services_examples"><div class="home-services_item-head"><div class="home-services_number"><div>10</div></div><h3 class="home-services_title">Other</h3></div><div class="home-services_services"><div class="tag-text w-richtext"><p>Digital agency</p><p>Corporate website</p><p>Landing Page</p><p>‍</p></div></div><div class="service-button_desktop"></div></div><div class="home-services_desc"><div class="home-services_img-wrap"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/cover-sea.webp" alt="Seatwiz branding on a stadium screen – hospitality and travel case" class="home-services_img"/></div><div class="home-services_text-wrap"><p class="text-color-grey-300-2">We design and develop websites and applications for various industries and types of businesses </p></div></div><div class="service-button_mobile"></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="service-sticky w-dyn-item"><div data-wf--home-services_item--variant="base" class="home-services_item"><div class="line-2 is-darker"></div><div class="home-services_item-in"><div class="home-services_examples"><div class="home-services_item-head"><div class="home-services_number"><div>10</div></div><h3 class="home-services_title">Nonprofit</h3></div><div class="home-services_services"><div class="tag-text w-richtext"><p>Nonprofit website</p><p>NGO</p><p>Campaign site</p><p>Donations</p><p>Storytelling</p><p>WordPress</p></div></div><div class="service-button_desktop"><a data-wf--button--variant="small-light" href="/industries/nonprofit-social-impact" class="button w-inline-block"><div class="button-in"><div class="button_texts"><div class="button_text _1">Show more</div><div aria-hidden="true" class="button_text _2">Show more</div></div><div class="button_glow-wrap"><div class="button_glow"></div></div></div></a></div></div><div class="home-services_desc"><div class="home-services_img-wrap"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/frame-1513.webp" alt="Sirius animal shelter website by Cosmos Studio" class="home-services_img"/></div><div class="home-services_text-wrap"><p class="text-color-grey-300-2">Nonprofit web design agency for NGOs, charities, and awareness campaigns. Short donation and adoption flows and a CMS your team can edit.</p></div></div><div class="service-button_mobile"><a data-wf--button--variant="medium-light" href="/industries/nonprofit-social-impact" class="button w-variant-9cb96ae5-a355-784d-c2ef-0196f705ac57 w-inline-block"><div class="button-in w-variant-9cb96ae5-a355-784d-c2ef-0196f705ac57"><div class="button_texts w-variant-9cb96ae5-a355-784d-c2ef-0196f705ac57"><div class="button_text w-variant-9cb96